  "what_this_is": "a machine-readable record of how the frozen results were produced and what they are. Derived from the published provenance records, the locked environment and the digest tool; never hand-edited. scripts/check_reproduction_report.py verifies it in CI.",
  "how_to_reproduce": {
    "install": "uv sync --extra science --extra dev --extra docking --frozen",
